Huh... I could... could use somethin' to relieve the pain. ::wheeze:: These green tumors, they often ache, they can even burst - they make life a living hell. Doc M. does his best... ::wheeze:: but morphine is the real doc. ::wheeze:: Three shots - and yer in.&lt;end&gt;</source>
